### 1. 1件登録する
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "APIの動作を確認する",
  "category": "プログラミング",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-09-15"
}

### 2. 1件取得する
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1

### 3. 1件更新する
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "APIの動作確認を完了する",
  "detail": "HTTPリクエストで動作を確認する",
  "category": "プログラミング",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-09-15",
  "completed": false
}

### 4. 1件削除する
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1

### 5. 祝日を直接取ってくる
GET https://holidays-jp.github.io/api/v1/date.json

### 6. 期間指定で取得する
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30

### 7. 窓口と会話を始める
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-06-18",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": { "name": "requests.http", "version": "1.0" }
  }
}

### 8. 道具の一覧をもらう
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: ae2b5fb1-ecc1-4f90-aec7-4b385c966110

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "tools/list", "params": {} }

### 9. 道具を1つ呼んでみる
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: ae2b5fb1-ecc1-4f90-aec7-4b385c966110

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "tools/call",
  "params": { "name": "list_todos", "arguments": {} } }
